## Design decisions

- **Persistence**: file-backed JSON `reader-texts.json` via `PersistentCodableStore.appSupportFileURL` + `loadArrayFromFile`, cloning `WordExplanationCacheStore`'s coalesced single-writer/off-main/atomic-write pattern (2s throttle — progress updates fire per paragraph). Tolerant `init(from:)` on `ReaderText` (only content essential; unknown `source` raw value → `.pasted`).
- **Library**: a `List` styled as free-floating `SMCard`s (clear row background, hidden separators) so rows get real `swipeActions` delete plus `contextMenu` delete for macOS parity. Coverage is computed lazily per row `.onAppear` and cached `[UUID: Int]` in-view. Sheet-created texts are opened via a `pendingOpen` + `onDismiss` handoff to avoid pushing while a sheet is still dismissing.
- **Session**: paragraphs snapshotted in `init`; only the current paragraph renders the interactive component — `RubyTextView` for CJK material (word-detail via `WordDetailPopover` in the exact TranslateView presentation: iOS `sheet(item:)` + NavigationStack + detents, macOS `popover(item:)`, both `.localizedSurface()`), `EnglishRubyTextView` → `EnglishWordDetailSheet` for English material (PhotoTranslateView pattern). Neighbors are plain `Text` (read ones dimmed), tap-to-focus. Restore position from `lastReadParagraphIndex` in `init` + deferred `scrollTo`; progress written on every index change. Bottom glass bar (`glassEffectCapsuleCompat`): read-aloud (`SpeechService.speakAuto`), prev/next, translate toggle, A−/A+ (clamped 15–33, `@AppStorage("readerFontSize")`). Per-paragraph translations via `AIWordExplanationService.shared.translateWithProvider`, cached `[Int: String]`, spinner while in flight, dismissible top banner on error, cancel-before-replace on the stored task (with visible-toggle cleanup for the cancelled paragraph). Toolbar shows "N% known" + verbatim "3/17".
- **Generation**: provider dispatch copied from `WordIdentificationService` (FoundationModels gated iOS 26/macOS 26 with `AIWordExplanationService.shared.isAvailable`, Ollama `enableThinking: false`, cloud `jsonMode: true` maxTokens 4096); tolerant parse via `AIWordExplanationService.extractJSONObject`; strict `{"title","story"}` shape with tolerant title decode. Known words: up to 80 unique, ≤20-char, shuffled headwords from the learning-language side of `SavedTermsStore` (`chineseSide`/`englishSide`). Bilingual parity keys off `learningIsChinese` everywhere: 中文 UI generates/translates English stories with Mandarin glosses (prompt explicitly forbids pinyin for Chinese stories only as annotation).
- Coverage heuristic: unique NL-segmented Chinese words vs saved `chineseSide`, or unique lowercased English tokens vs saved lowercased `englishSide`; labeled "~X% known" to signal it's an estimate.

